<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLSB0A5106045">B1 Brake Components</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Put a mark (1) on piston rod at point where it intersects with transaxle case. 
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IEL10C510374.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "55.560mm" ver = "02" gw = "202" gh = "141"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Measure stroke between transaxle case (1) and mark (2) on piston rod when applying compressed air (400 kPa, 4.1 kgf/cm<sup>2</sup>, 58.0 psi) into oil hole as shown in figure.
</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>
B1 piston rod stroke
</title>
<ptxt>
“a”: 5.5 – 6.0 mm (0.21 – 0.23 in.)
</ptxt>
</spec>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IEL10C510375.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "80.840mm" ver = "02" gw = "215" gh = "213"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
